# Frontend Architecture Rules

## File Placement

| What | Where |
|------|-------|
| Route-level pages | `src/pages/{Name}Page.tsx` |
| Reusable UI | `src/components/{domain}/` |
| Layouts | `src/layouts/` |
| API calls | `src/services/{domain}Service.ts` |
| Global state | `src/store/{name}Store.ts` |
| TypeScript types | `src/types/{domain}.ts` |
| Route definitions | `src/routes/index.tsx` |
| Custom hooks | `src/hooks/use{Name}.ts` |

## Rules

- All API calls go through `src/services/` — never raw fetch/axios in components
- Pages compose components; pages do not contain business logic
- Types in `src/types/` must mirror backend schemas in `docs/API_SPEC.md`
- New pages require LLD.md §15 and §17 updates before creation
- Use Tailwind CSS; no CSS modules unless justified in PR

## Route Registration

New routes must be added to `src/routes/index.tsx` AND documented in LLD.md §17.

## Auth

- Tokens managed by `authStore.ts`
- Protected routes use `DashboardLayout` with auth guard
- API interceptor in `services/api.ts` handles token refresh
